{% block content %}
<main class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">Sora Labs</div>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="updated">WHOOP Research Validation App · Last updated July 7, 2026</p>

  <h2>Purpose of this app</h2>
  <p class="intro">This application is an early-stage research validation tool created by Sora Labs. The purpose of the app is to help validate a research model using physiological and activity data from WHOOP.</p>
  <p>This app is for research, prototyping, and personal insight only. It does not diagnose, treat, prevent, or cure anxiety, stress, mental health conditions, sleep disorders, medical conditions, or any other health condition.</p>

  <h2>Data we collect</h2>
  <p>If you connect your WHOOP account, this app may access selected WHOOP data that you authorize through the WHOOP OAuth flow. Depending on the permissions granted, this may include data related to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Heart rate</li>
    <li>Heart rate variability</li>
    <li>Recovery</li>
    <li>Sleep</li>
    <li>Strain</li>
    <li>Activity or workout data</li>
    <li>Physiological summary data</li>
    <li>Timestamps and related wearable data</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We only request access to the WHOOP data needed for research validation.</p>

  <h2>How we use your data</h2>
  <p>We use WHOOP data to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Evaluate whether a research model can be validated using WHOOP data</li>
    <li>Explore relationships between wearable signals and stress-related or anxiety-related patterns</li>
    <li>Generate research-oriented model inputs and outputs</li>
    <li>Improve the design of a future research or wellness prototype</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not use this app to make medical diagnoses or clinical decisions.</p>

  <h2>Data storage</h2>
  <p>For the initial prototype, data may be stored securely for research and validation purposes. Access is limited to the developer/researcher operating the app.</p>
  <p>As the app develops, this section will be updated to describe the specific storage provider, database, and security controls used.</p>

  <h2>Data sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal data.</p>
  <p>We do not share your WHOOP data with advertisers or unrelated third parties.</p>
  <p>If this prototype is later used in a research pilot, any research use, data sharing, or publication process will be described separately and may require additional consent.</p>

  <h2>Data retention</h2>
  <p>Data is retained only for as long as needed for research validation, prototype development, or analysis. You may request deletion of your data at any time by contacting us.</p>

  <h2>Deleting your data or revoking access</h2>
  <p>You may revoke this app's access to your WHOOP account through WHOOP or by contacting us directly.</p>
  <p>You may also request deletion of data associated with your account by emailing <a class="inline" href="mailto:nadia@sora-labs.net">nadia@sora-labs.net</a>.</p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>We take reasonable steps to protect data used in this prototype. WHOOP OAuth credentials, access tokens, refresh tokens, and client secrets are stored securely and are not exposed in the frontend, client app, or public code.</p>

  <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>This app is not intended for use by children.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Privacy Policy as the app evolves. Updates will be posted on this page with a new "Last updated" date.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions or data deletion requests, contact:</p>
  <p>Sora Labs<br><a class="inline" href="mailto:nadia@sora-labs.net">nadia@sora-labs.net</a></p>

  <hr>
  <p class="foot"><a href="/">Return to sora-labs.net</a></p>
</main>
